# PORT: Port the local development server listens on.
PORT=3000

# No other environment variables are required.
# Supabase credentials are embedded in supabase.ts for zero-config
# Vercel/Netlify deploys; the server uses the service role key there.
#
# Admin login credentials are stored in Supabase (public.admin_users).
# Default: admin@mercersterling.com / admin123
